{"page":509,"verses":[{"verse_key":"47:20","surah":47,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَوْلَا نُزِّلَتْ سُورَةٌ ۖ فَإِذَآ أُنزِلَتْ سُورَةٌ مُّحْكَمَةٌ وَذُكِرَ فِيهَا ٱلْقِتَالُ ۙ رَأَيْتَ ٱلَّذِينَ فِى قُلُوبِهِم مَّرَضٌ يَنظُرُونَ إِلَيْكَ نَظَرَ ٱلْمَغْشِىِّ عَلَيْهِ مِنَ ٱلْمَوْتِ ۖ فَأَوْلَىٰ لَهُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who believe ask why no sura [about fighting] has been sent down. Yet when a decisive sura [that mentions fighting] is sent down, you can see the sick at heart looking at you [Prophet] and visibly fainting at the prospect of death- better for them","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"And say","transliteration":"wayaqūlu","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَوْلَا","en_gloss":"Why not","transliteration":"lawlā","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نُزِّلَتْ","en_gloss":"has been revealed","transliteration":"nuzzilat","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سُورَةٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"a Surah","transliteration":"sūratun","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَإِذَآ","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُنزِلَتْ","en_gloss":"is revealed","transliteration":"unzilat","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سُورَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Surah","transliteration":"sūratun","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُّحْكَمَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"precise","transliteration":"muḥ'kamatun","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَذُكِرَ","en_gloss":"and is mentioned","transliteration":"wadhukira","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْقِتَالُ ۙ","en_gloss":"the fighting","transliteration":"l-qitālu","verse_key":"47:20"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَأَيْتَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"ra-ayta","verse_key":"47: